#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.res_config_settings_view_form_inherit_l10n_ve_exchange
msgid ""
"Applies only to CUSTOMER invoices and credit notes. The exchange difference "
"left when reconciling a foreign-currency customer invoice is documented as a"
" real Debit Note (loss) or Credit Note (gain), instead of a generic entry."
msgstr ""
"Aplica solo a facturas y notas de crédito de CLIENTE. El diferencial "
"cambiario que quede al conciliar una factura de cliente en moneda "
"extranjera se documenta como Nota de Débito (pérdida) o Nota de Crédito "
"(ganancia) real, en vez de un asiento genérico."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_journal__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_company__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
msgid ""
"Applies only to CUSTOMER invoices and credit notes. When enabled, the "
"exchange difference left open when reconciling a foreign-currency customer "
"invoice is NOT absorbed by Odoo's automatic entry -- instead, it is "
"documented with a real Debit Note (loss) or Credit Note (gain), issued "
"against the original invoice and reconciled against the remaining residual."
msgstr ""
"Aplica solo a facturas y notas de crédito de CLIENTE. Cuando está "
"activado, el diferencial cambiario que queda abierto al conciliar una "
"factura de cliente en moneda extranjera NO es absorbido por el asiento "
"automático de Odoo -- en su lugar, se documenta con una Nota de Débito "
"(pérdida) o Nota de Crédito (ganancia) real, emitida contra la factura "
"original y conciliada contra el residual restante."

