#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_original_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_original_id
msgid "Reversed Exchange Difference Debit Note"
msgstr "Nota de Débito de Diferencial Cambiario Revertida"

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
msgid ""
"Payment entry whose reconciliation against the source invoice originated "
"this exchange difference Debit/Credit Note. Used to tell apart the note from"
" a SPECIFIC partial payment from a note already issued for the same invoice "
"from an EARLIER partial payment -- an invoice paid in several installments "
"can accrue a distinct exchange difference note per installment."
msgstr ""
"Asiento de pago cuya conciliación contra la factura de origen generó esta "
"Nota de Débito/Crédito de diferencial cambiario. Se usa para distinguir la "
"nota de un pago parcial ESPECÍFICO de una nota ya emitida para la misma "
"factura por un pago parcial ANTERIOR -- una factura pagada en varias "
"cuotas puede acumular una nota de diferencial distinta por cada cuota."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
msgid "Settled Payment (Exchange Difference)"
msgstr "Pago Liquidado (Diferencial Cambiario)"

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_journal__l10n_ve_exchange_debit_note_sequence_id
msgid ""
"Sequence used to number exchange difference Debit Notes. Configure the "
"prefix, padding, and periodicity from the sequence record itself."
msgstr ""
"Secuencia usada para numerar las Notas de Débito de diferencial cambiario. "
"Configure el prefijo, el relleno (padding) y la periodicidad desde el "
"propio registro de la secuencia."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_is_credit_note
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_is_credit_note
msgid ""
"Set when this note was created directly as a Credit Note (exchange gain), as"
" opposed to being the reversal of a Debit Note (see "
"`l10n_ve_exchange_original_id`)."
msgstr ""
"Se establece cuando esta nota fue creada directamente como Nota de Crédito "
"(ganancia cambiaria), a diferencia de ser una reversión de una Nota de "
"Débito (ver `l10n_ve_exchange_original_id`)."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_invoice_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_invoice_id
msgid "Source Customer Invoice (Exchange Difference)"
msgstr "Factura de Cliente de Origen (Diferencial Cambiario)"

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"The Customer Invoice Exchange Difference Note Product ('%(product)s') must "
"be a service."
msgstr ""
"El Producto de Nota de Diferencial Cambiario de Facturas de Cliente "
"('%(product)s') debe ser un servicio."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"The Customer Invoice Exchange Difference Note Product ('%(product)s') must "
"have the company's exchange gain account as its income account."
msgstr ""
"El Producto de Nota de Diferencial Cambiario de Facturas de Cliente "
"('%(product)s') debe tener la cuenta de ganancia cambiaria de la compañía "
"como su cuenta de ingreso."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"The Customer Invoice Exchange Difference Note Product ('%(product)s') must "
"have the company's exchange loss account as its expense account."
msgstr ""
"El Producto de Nota de Diferencial Cambiario de Facturas de Cliente "
"('%(product)s') debe tener la cuenta de pérdida cambiaria de la compañía "
"como su cuenta de gasto."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"The Customer Invoice Exchange Difference Note Product ('%(product)s') must "
"have the default sale Exempt tax assigned (Settings > Accounting > Exempt "
"Tax)."
msgstr ""
"El Producto de Nota de Diferencial Cambiario de Facturas de Cliente "
"('%(product)s') debe tener asignado el impuesto Exento de venta por "
"defecto (Ajustes > Contabilidad > Impuesto Exento)."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_journal__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_company__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ve_exchange_use_nd_nc
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.res_config_settings_view_form_inherit_l10n_ve_exchange
msgid "Use Debit/Credit Notes for Customer Invoice Exchange Difference"
msgstr "Usar Notas de Débito/Crédito para Diferencial Cambiario de Facturas de Cliente"

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_exchange_difference/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot directly unreconcile an exchange difference Debit/Credit Note. To"
" undo it, break the original reconciliation between the invoice and the "
"payment -- the note will be reversed automatically."
msgstr ""
"No se puede desconciliar directamente una Nota de Débito/Crédito de "
"diferencial cambiario. Para deshacerla, rompa la conciliación original "
"entre la factura y el pago -- la nota se revertirá automáticamente."

